Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Game entry, boot TIM upload, skip opening movies

Rename main to dw3_game_main for the PC host bootstrap; upload boot TIM
from STAGE_VRAM (preloaded with runtime/us/boot_tim.bin); start at
MODE_TITLE so Phase 2 can reach the title screen without STR movies.
Quit when PSY-Z requests window close. Log mode entry for host bring-up.
Call ResetGraph before the first SetDispMask (PSY-Z GPU table).
Skip the TIM ID with a +4 byte offset on 64-bit hosts.

